        "text": "**B) Leave forever.**\n\nStaying would mean knowingly profiting from a child's suffering every day, and I couldn't keep living with that comfort. Leaving doesn't free the child, but it refuses to take part in the bargain. I'd also recognize that my choice has costs, since I'd be giving up my family, my community, and the life I built, and I wouldn't pretend otherwise.",
